  "title": "Angola: Start-up of the New Gas Consortium Quiluma Offshore Gas Field",
  "summary": "Paris, March 17, 2026 – TotalEnergies announces the start of production from the Quiluma field, in which the Company holds an 11.8% interest alongside its partners Azule Energy (37.4%, operator), Cabinda Gulf Oil Company (31%) and Sonangol E&P (19.8%). This is the first development of a non-associated gas field in Angola and the gas produced […]",
